<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 7 July <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/edward-i-of-england"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/edward-i-of-england.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Edward I of England</span><span class="tp">1239–1307</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/sigismund-ii-augustus"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/sigismund-ii-augustus.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Sigismund II Augustus</span><span class="tp">d. 1572</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/thomas-hooker"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/thomas-hooker.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Thomas Hooker</span><span class="tp">1586–1647</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/marthanda-varma"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/marthanda-varma.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Marthanda Varma</span><span class="tp">1706–1758</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/arthur-conan-doyle"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/arthur-conan-doyle.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Arthur Conan Doyle</span><span class="tp">1859–1930</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/eduard-shevardnadze"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/eduard-shevardnadze.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Eduard Shevardnadze</span><span class="tp">1928–2014</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jovenel-moise"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jovenel-moise.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jovenel Moïse</span><span class="tp">1968–2021</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
